# CODEOWNERS for the platform-gitops monorepo.
#
# Platform team owns everything by default. Per-team subdirectories under
# /teams/<name>/ are owned by that team — they can self-merge changes to
# their own service manifests without platform review.
#
# Onboarding a new team adds two lines: a /teams/<name>/ ownership line here
# and the config file under /config/teams/. The config file itself stays
# under platform review (it grants Entra group access and sets quotas).

* @org/platform-team

# Per-team workload manifests — owned by the team.
/teams/team-a/   @org/team-a
/teams/team-b/   @org/team-b

# Team config files (quotas, group bindings, identity client IDs) stay under
# platform review even though they reference team resources.
/config/teams/   @org/platform-team
